<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B More Experiments ‣ Equipping Retrieval-Augmented Large Language Models with Document Structure Awareness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Chunking Comparison</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B More Experiments ‣ Equipping Retrieval-Augmented Large Language Models with Document Structure Awareness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span>Short-form QA Performance</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS6" title="In Appendix B More Experiments ‣ Equipping Retrieval-Augmented Large Language Models with Document Structure Awareness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.6 </span>Router Generalization Experiments</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS7" title="In Appendix B More Experiments ‣ Equipping Retrieval-Augmented Large Language Models with Document Structure Awareness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.7 </span>Further Analysis</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
