<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Training details</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We choose Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct as the backbone of the routing model and employ LoRA for efficient fine-tuning. Specifically, we set lora_rank as 8, lora_alpha as 16, gradient accumulated batch size as 8, learning rate as 1e-5 and epoch as 5. We also compare different training settings, as shown in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.2 Training details ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Equipping Retrieval-Augmented Large Language Models with Document Structure Awareness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, and finally select the model based on instruct model with tag format prompt.</p>
</div>
