<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Main results on ASQA dataset. We report full results of different API and open-source models, together with results of no-retrieval and retrieve-and-read baselines. <span id="A2.T5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> and <span id="A2.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Underline</span> denote the best overall and in-category results, respectively. FT refers to methods finetuned on the corresponding training set. * marks the results from our reproduction.</figcaption>
</figure>
