</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T15.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T15.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T15.2.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Titan (roller coaster)</span></th>
<td id="A4.T15.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A4.T15.2.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T15.2.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T15.2.1.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFF00;">Titan</span></span>
<span id="A4.T15.2.1.9.2.1.2" class="ltx_p">is a steel hyper coaster located at Six Flags Over Texas in Arlington, Texas. Unlike most hypercoasters, Titan is a combination of an out and back roller coaster and a twister roller coaster. It stands at 245 feet and contains a 255 drop at 85 miles per hour. It is the tallest, fastest, and longest coaster in Texas.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
